# Search endpoint query models

For parameter-heavy Search (list/filter) actions, bind one query object with `[FromQuery]` instead of many individual parameters.

```csharp
[HttpGet]
public async Task<IActionResult> Search(
    [FromQuery] ProductSearchRequest request,
    [FromServices] ISearchProductRecordsQueryHandler handler,
    CancellationToken cancellationToken)
```

- Place the model under `Models/{Resource}/` (e.g. `ProductSearchRequest`).
- Include pagination/continuation on the same object when it is query-string driven.
- Prefer GET + query object; use POST body only when filters cannot reasonably be query strings.
